  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "做伙來唸詩 - Luān Tshun-hong"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: black; font-size: 36px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px; text-align: center;\">Luān Tshun-hong</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0px;\">/ 雁翎</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEinQs261IdxQs_juq2rXcrgwEd7tg1yHySPc_uRcTilIPhx3S0MtyhKP4ZYTbAbmg6WEOv9X42P0qgzhOUL27H435iTQ95Z7nbu2dGbAOGG-j3gd-pILCE-tu_cOPWm4mQvH5o4wPhxd3IU1J80GIuA0O2p899DElynBA4N9aHbDd-7ATUazkx4y3jji4Ly\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjMwzcwT4PKBl6gbAi9R2Mdy9mrdn_8QT7pMBNcGAtGJQxMYLn9QJxYec5HO89nc1ZL7oerRavFdhC_4FNW-FgSFrFTVGBqFYdAOvcOdE1jFwSNcp4S5sRBiH9pDASrI-Ckycf1vSuit_qCiYnvTvmKSHWm9K9FmjJFjgzrVgA1eY0rPsJPnD8xGkBKdc1Y\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; padding: 0px 10px; text-align: justify;\">\n        Ka-tsài ū lí ê ài<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>tshin-tshiūnn 1 tsūn tshun-thinn ê hong<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>khin-khin tshue--kuè-lâi<br />Kā guán ê sè-kài<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>ka-thiam tām-po̍h-á bí-lē ê sik-tshái<br /><br />Siāng ài thiann lí tshiùnn-khik liām kua-si<br />1 kù 1 jī, lóng ū bû-hān ê tsîng-ì<br />Hōo guán thé-huē tio̍h <br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>thuân-thóng bûn-ha̍k iu-ngá ê tshù-bī<br /><br />Ka-tsài ū lí ê ài<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>tshin-tshiūnn 1 tsūn tshun-thinn ê hong<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>tiām-tiām tshue--kuè-lâi<br />Tshue-ji̍p sim-kuann-lāi<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>kánn-ná thîng-hûn-kà-bū hiah tsū-tsāi<br /><br />Siāng ài phuānn lí tha̍k-tsheh siá bûn-tsiunn<br />Nn̄g lâng pênn-puann-iūnn<br />Khó-pí tsuí-ah kap uan-iunn<br />Hōo guán siūnn-khí<br />\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>khîm-sik-tsê-tsàu hô-hâi ê bôo-iūnn<br /><br />Hong--ah hong--ah, lí tio̍h thiann guá kóng<br />Hue-luí in-uī lí, tsiah ē hun-hong<br />Khong-khì in-uī lí, tsiah ē liû-thong<br /><br />Ū lí, tsiah ū un-luán<br />Ū lí, tsiah ū uân-buán<br />In-uī lí sī guán sènn-miā ê tsuân-guân<br /><br />Ka-tsài ū lí ê ài<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>tshin-tshiūnn 1 tsūn tshun-thinn ê hong<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>tsiām-tsiām tshue--kuè-lâi<br />Kā guán ê iu-tshiû kap kám-khài<br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>lóng-tsóng tshue ji̍p-khì <br /><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>kang-iûnn-tuā-hái\t\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 40px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjRyBwV2qmwN7lihYQhlBL6eAgLJJdsrrBpSPc4kQp89xrU4BHgspIC7QmrFX7evJavlOhLCjtPx4iKPH5nmu1zXESrMcUPD1Nk5Td9hL_ERq8i1GDid8ESy04C-wlfvSBJ8QVNCqwL6L9gbGheUXLO80iH15tahzf2iO2KPZac7MfdSTBotktfdC4gjC22\" style=\"display: block; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 384期，2026年03月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
